(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 384.81 18.542 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "55c0361e-cf96-4a46-b4d9-fc66eb01cf3e"))
(text "J23 E-stop feed -> SMDJ36CA TVS -> LM74700-Q1 ideal diode + BSC070N10NS5\n(reverse battery to -65 V) -> VBAT_ESTOP_PRE: E-stop status sense (R251 ->\nU34), trip driver bias (R400). Rail cut TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 2 mOhm\n(trip 15.8/20/24.8 A), latch-off (100k across C_TMR), enabled by WD_OK AND\nESTOP_OK AND RC_ALLOW (74LVC1G11) -> VBAT_ESTOP: engine slot (fuel/crank/glow)\nand ADC readback R411. Re-arm after a trip: firmware toggles RC_ALLOW (PB7).\nSwitched bleeder: RC_EN low -> AO3400A off -> IRLML0100 gate to +5V_TRIP ->\n1.1k (2x 2.2k 2512 1 W) on VBAT_ESTOP: tau ~2 ms, 32 V -> 2 V in <= 6.6 ms;\nstuck-on rail-cut FETs at 32 V = 0.47 W per resistor. Replaces Q70/Q71\nSQD40P10-40L, D137, R627.\nPass 6 B1 Q2 hold-off: BAT_IN -> 1N4148W -> MMBT5401 (22k E-B, 68k to VBAT_P:\non when BAT_IN - VBAT_P > 2.5-3.8 V) -> 22k -> 100 nF || 100k (46-270 us) ->\nMMBT3904 -> BAT54C pulls BB_UVLO (U2 EN/UVLO, discharges C602 1 uF in <= 0.25\nms; C602 was 10 uF) to <= 0.45 V while Q2 is still ramping; Option B: D402.2\nNC, Q123/Q124 (47k/100k/47k) lock out hold-off on U5_EN while +3V3_BK is up,\nU5_VIN (via D417 SS110 + R1130 2.2k/D418 SS110 + 2x 100u 63V hold-up) rides\nthrough 10 ms @ 24 V / 20 ms @ 32 V. Math: docs/modular/pass6_fix_calc.txt,\ndocs/spice/README.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 386.08 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dc675fac-acd1-48d8-8972-11d671f8d90f"))
(embedded_fonts no))
